Who are you?

4
00:00:04.174 --> 00:00:04.734
I'm a baboon.

5
00:00:05.294 --> 00:00:14.120
Baboons are large Where do you live?

6
00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:31.849
We live in Africa and Arabia.

7
00:00:33.429 --> 00:00:35.730
We like forests and savannas.

8
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.451
What do you eat?

9
00:00:39.851 --> 00:00:41.492
We eat plants and meat.

10
00:00:43.532 --> 00:00:46.133
We like fruit, insects, and bark.

11
00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.854
Sometimes we eat birds or even sheep.

12
00:00:51.654 --> 00:00:53.495
You climb trees, right?

13
00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:56.956
We usually stay on the ground.

14
00:00:58.464 --> 00:01:00.785
But we climb trees to watch for enemies.

15
00:01:02.546 --> 00:01:04.427
We also sleep in trees.

16
00:01:06.527 --> 00:01:08.668
You live in a big group!

17
00:01:10.889 --> 00:01:12.630
Most baboons live in groups.

18
00:01:14.471 --> 00:01:16.792
We talk to each other by making sounds.

19
00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.074
Do baboons help each other?

20
00:01:24.495 --> 00:01:26.716
We remove dirt and bugs from each other.

21
00:01:29.161 --> 00:01:30.402
This keeps us clean.

22
00:01:31.243 --> 00:01:33.105
